<title>FINLAND: BALANSOR SEES 96/97 PROFIT EQUAL TO 95/96.</title>
<headline>BALANSOR SEES 96/97 PROFIT EQUAL TO 95/96.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish investment company Balansor Oy said on Wednesday its profit for the full financial year to end-October would be on the same level as last year, when it made a profit after financial items of 1.6 million markka.</p>
<p>&quot;The profitability of the Balansor group is expected to develop favourably and the profit ... is expected to be at the same level as in the previous year,&quot; Balansor said in a statement with its six-month results to end-April.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-670 50 235</p>
</text>
